	// Vpise se skupni znesek ostalih davkov oziroma dajatev (razen DDV), ki so na racunu. Podatek se vpisuje le, ce racun vsebuje davke oziroma dajatve, ki niso DDV. Decimalno locilo je pika. / The total amount is entered of other taxes or duties (except VAT), which are on the invoice. The data is entered only if the invoice includes taxes or duties, which are not VAT. The decimal separator is a dot.
